@startuml 14_state_residency
' ResidencyState as observed through llama-swap's event stream. Anemoi reports these
' states; it does not enforce them, and the enum has no transition function.
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state "Cold\n(not in residents)" as Cold
state "Loading" as Loading
state "HotGpu" as HotGpu
state "Draining" as Draining

[*] --> Cold
Cold --> Loading : SSE state = starting
Loading --> HotGpu : SSE state = ready
HotGpu --> Draining : SSE state = stopping
Draining --> Cold : SSE state = stopped\nor shutdown

note right of HotGpu
  Vocabulary with no llama-swap mapping:
  WarmCpu, Partial, Serving, Evicting, Failed.
  They can come from config
  initial_residents and mock adapters.
end note
@enduml
